Changes: perspective-normalized eye patches, corner/head geometry inputs,
stride-4 eye network, train-only normalization; seed 9201. Participants p00-p12
were used for training, p13 for epoch selection and p14 for public evaluation.
This is not the official leave-one-participant-out benchmark.

